File Index

/CodegenView.test.tsx
Purpose: CodegenView tests: add-spec + live 4-section preview, archetype switch swaps fieldsets, stock-name collision disables save, save carries baseHash, 409 conflict panel + save-anyway, spec removal.

/CodegenView.tsx
Purpose: New-spell codegen sub-view (Phase 14a) — index-keyed DRAFT spec list (pre-deploy data, so index identity, unlike name-keyed skill rows), per-archetype fieldsets, LIVE 4-section C patch preview via generateSpellC called client-side (merc-area is bundled, same precedent as validateSkills), informational skills.dat-shape preview (labeled: editable via the Skills page only AFTER the const.c patch is compiled in — never a live save), patch download as a client-side blob, spec-manifest PUT with baseHash + ConflictPanel. 2026-07-26 (UX polish pass): hand-rolled toast JSX replaced by the shared features/shared/Toast.js component — also fixed a real bug where the 'ok' kind rendered with no --ok class at all (only --err was ever applied), now correctly styled green. Step 6: its two bare `(e as Error).message`-only catches (initial load, save/save-anyway) gained "server unreachable: "/"save failed: " prefixes, matching the convention every other tab already used.

/GroupsView.test.tsx
