/GroupsView.tsx
Purpose: Groups sub-view (Phase 8) — edits groups.dat, the boot-time overlay onto group_table; per-class "available" toggle mapping the -1 sentinel, cost NumFields, member list with skill/group picker + prefix-resolution hints (mirrors group_add: skill-first), cycle errors disable save, manual pane, copyover note, revert-to-stock DELETE. Phase 12: baseHash conditional saves + ConflictPanel on 409. 2026-07-26 (UX polish pass): hand-rolled toast JSX replaced by the shared features/shared/Toast.js component (same missing--ok-class fix as CodegenView/SkillsPage). Step 6: its four bare `(e as Error).message`-only catches (load, save, save-anyway, revert, manual-apply) gained "server unreachable: "/"save failed: "/"revert failed: "/"manual text does not parse: " prefixes respectively.

/SkillsPage.test.tsx
