/SkillsPage.tsx
Purpose: Skills tab (Phase 7) — edits skills.dat, the boot-time data overlay onto the compiled skill_table (NOT an area file: one global optional file, own fetch/save flow); name/slot/gsn read-only, spell-function picker with the stock (fun,target) pair guard, msg_obj null checkbox, manual pane with back-apply, copyover-only note, revert-to-stock DELETE. Hosts the Skills/Groups/New-spell-codegen sub-view switch (Phases 8, 14a). Phase 12: holds baseHash (null=stock), conditional saves, ConflictPanel on 409 (reload / save-anyway). 2026-07-26 (UX polish pass): hand-rolled toast JSX replaced by the shared features/shared/Toast.js component (same missing--ok-class fix as CodegenView/GroupsView). Step 6: its four bare `(e as Error).message`-only catches gained the same "X failed: " prefix treatment as GroupsView/CodegenView.
